- Game Board: Fixed player pod positioning for inactive users to remain consistent on the table layout;
- Typography: Introduced a centralized and consistent typography system for better brand alignment;
- Buttons: Resized buttons across components to fit their content naturally and avoid overflow;
- Profile Page: Adjusted spacing and layout for improved responsiveness on different screen sizes;
- Game Rules Modal: Enhanced readability and layout of the modal for better user understanding;
- Lobby Page: Reworked the layout and polished the "Create Room" modal to improve clarity and spacing.

